WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Try not to think of a white bear. An instruction changes the task.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1987, volunteers reported their thoughts. They rang a bell when the bear appeared.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A bell records a report. It does not reveal every thought.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Later studies often found rebound. Immediate increases were more conditional.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Returning attention is not the same as forcing the mind to go blank.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A preference is not a brainwave test. A seller claim is not a proven result.
